id: pm-beads-6aag
title: Reject escaped heredoc operator text
description: "Fix Greptile PR 88 finding 3890132430: escaped less-than characters are accepted as a heredoc operator after token normalization."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-30T18:10:30.402Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-30T18:14:53.032Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-30T18:14:52.543Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-30T18:14:52.543Z"
author: pi-agent
severity: high
repro_steps: "echo x\\<\\<EOF suppresses a later scalar assignment and hides its variable-routed publish."
resolution: Mark normalized escaped characters as protected syntax positions and reject heredoc matches crossing them.
expected_result: Escaped operator characters remain literal argument text.
actual_result: "Escape removal loses syntax provenance, opening a synthetic heredoc."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T18:14:51.638Z",pi-agent,"Greptile 3890132430 reproduced: source-only revert made echo x\\\\<\\\\<EOF open synthetic heredoc suppression and fail the focused regression, SOURCE_ONLY_REVERT_EXIT=1. Restored source marks escaped characters as syntax-protected alongside quoted characters. Map and attested-sibling audit regressions pass; npm test, 100% coverage, docstring, and release:check all pass."
